-- (3A): "Despite subsection (3), a secretary or his or her agent or clerk of a private company need not be physically present at the registered office ... if a secretary or his or her agent or clerk of the private company is
-- readily contactable by a person at the registered office by telephone or other means of instantaneous communication during those times".
